	Description = [[<h1>TVPaint Data Nodes</h1>
<p>The TVPaint data nodes for Blackmagic Design Resolve/Fusion allow you to interact with 2D animation data inside a node graph. This approach works with a series of nodal operators that allow you to edit and modify the TVPaint data on the fly.</p>

<p>Note: The TVPaint toolset's capabilities are enhanced with the installation of the Reactor package named "Vonk Ultra" that is found in the "Kartaverse/Vonk Ultra" category in the Reactor window.</p>

